<p:notes xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Slide Image Placeholder 1"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1" noRot="1" noChangeAspect="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldImg"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Notes Placeholder 2"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SOURCE KEY</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>A: https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B-GGUF/tree/main (chosen weight file and size).</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>B: https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B (original model card); https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B/blob/main/</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>config.json</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t> (architecture).</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>Cache setting: assumed 16-bit values, 2 bytes each. This is independent of the chosen Q4_K_M weights.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>All arithmetic results are calculated estimates, not measured peak memory.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>DELIVERY</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>Use after the Hugging Face screenshot. Click to reveal the calculations.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SPEAKER NARRATION</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>This table makes every factor in the KV-cache calculation explicit. The first factor of two means keys and values. The architecture configuration specifies 36 transformer layers, 8 key/value heads per layer, and 128 values in each head's vector. The final factor of two means two bytes per cached numerical value, which is our chosen 16-bit cache assumption. It is not two bytes per token. A token needs 2 × 36 × 8 × 128 = 73,728 numerical values across the cache. At two bytes each, this is 147,456 bytes per cached token. The first two is structural, and the last two is a precision setting. The Q4_K_M filename describes weight quantization and does not specify cache precision. The memory rate is specific to this architecture and our cache setting. The architecture fields come from the original Qwen3-8B </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>config.json</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>. With GGUF, the converted model's metadata and runtime should reflect the architecture and selected cache representation. No part of this arithmetic establishes runtime overhead.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SOURCES</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B/blob/main/</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>config.json</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/docs/transformers/</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>cache_explanation</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvP